  "text": "Allergies:\n? antibiotic / Amoxicillin\n\nChief Complaint:\nLeft ICA aneurysm\n\nHistory of Present Illness:\nKnown Left ICA aneurysm, presets for elective coiling\n\nBrief Hospital Course:\nMs. ___ presented to the hospital for an elective stent \nassisted coiling of a left ICA aneurysm. Post procedure the \npatient was extubated and transfered to the ICU for close \nmonitoring.\n\nOn Post procedure day one, the patient was tolerating a diet, \nvoiding and pain free.  She was discharged home with a \nperscriiption for ASA and plavix and follow up directions.\n\nDischarge Diagnosis:\nStent assisted coiling of Left ICA aneurysm",
